        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_77c1d1acf1554106a19e98b8692b14aa",
      "statement": "For context-bearing server execution, make_graph requires a nonempty thread ID and workspace context, validates the durable thread workspace binding, and selects a binding-specific runtime; without execution context it returns the configured server runtime.",
